body:
I'm going to use partialUpdateObject for updating one attribute by ObjectID.
But not working.
"TypeError: index.partialUpdateObject is not a function" is occured.
But index.search is working.
Following code shows my code.
JS:
```js
const client = algoliasearch(API_ID, AdminAPIKey);

  // 1. Initialize the target and temporary indices
  const index = client.initIndex(INDEXNAME);

index.search({ query: 'query string' }, (err, content) => {
  if (err) {
    console.log(err);
    console.log(err.debugData);
    return;
  }
  console.log(content.hits);
});

index.partialUpdateObject({
  test_attribute: 'testvalue',
  objectID: 'XXX'
}, function (err, content) {
  if (err) throw err;

  console.log(content);
});
```

HTML:
```html
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/algoliasearch@3.32.0/dist/algoliasearchLite.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/instantsearch.js@3.0.0"></script>
```

What do I have to do for partialUpdateObject?
Do I have to run following npm commands? If then, where do I have to run?
```
npm install --save algoliasearch
npm install --save-dev @types/algoliasearch
```

Thank you.
